[0.000, "o", "Inside the Barrow\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "You are inside an ancient barrow hidden deep within a dark forest. The barrow opens into a narrow\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "tunnel at its southern end. You can see a faint glow at the far end.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "A sword of Elvish workmanship is on the ground.\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "A strangely familiar brass lantern is lying on the ground.\r\u001b[30d>"]
