[0.000, "o", "You are standing at the southern end of a narrow tunnel where it opens into a wide cavern. The\r\u001b[26dcavern is dimly illuminated by phosphorescent mosses clinging to its high ceiling. A deep ravine\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "winds through the cavern, with a small stream at the bottom. The walls of the ravine are steep and\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "crumbly. A foot bridge crosses the ravine to the south.\r\u001b[30d>"]
